                                <Response Role="GOSSIP_OBECNY_MUZ_1" ReferenceLength="3"><Text StringName="goss_gossip_ha_slysels_o__Of1V" Text="Did you hear about Tonda?" /></Response>
                                <Response Role="GOSSIP_OBECNY_MUZ_1" ReferenceLength="3"><Text StringName="goss_gossip_ha_lidi_rikaj_vnls" Text="Seems his lamp dripped onto his uniform down the pit and it went up like that." /></Response>
                                <Response Role="GOSSIP_OBECNY_MUZ_1" ReferenceLength="3"><Text StringName="goss_gossip_ha_jo_je_cele_FYTe" Text="Yeah, he burnt himself and he's got terrible injuries." /></Response>
                                <Response Role="GOSSIP_OBECNY_MUZ_1" ReferenceLength="3"><Text StringName="goss_gossip_ha_navic_se_p_ZPPT" Text="On top of that, the poor bugger banged his head on the rock and couldn't make it up top on his own." /></Response>
                                <Response Role="GOSSIP_OBECNY_MUZ_1" ReferenceLength="3"><Text StringName="goss_gossip_ha_vytahli_ho_EGzg" Text="He was scorched black when they pulled him out." /></Response>
                                <Response Role="GOSSIP_OBECNY_MUZ_2" ReferenceLength="3"><Text StringName="goss_gossip_ha_to_je_hroz_YXoZ" Text="That's horrible... Tonda was always a clumsy youngster, but I wouldn't wish that on anyone." /></Response>
                                <Response Role="GOSSIP_OBECNY_MUZ_1" ReferenceLength="3"><Text StringName="goss_gossip_ha_ten_je_na__iF76" Text="He's in a bad way... Ever since then he reckons he's going to get a nasty disease." /></Response>
                                <Response Role="GOSSIP_OBECNY_MUZ_2" ReferenceLength="3"><Text StringName="goss_gossip_ha_to_naposle_hnND" Text="Yeah, except that fire underground is dangerous and now nobody wants to risk a rock fall." /></Response>
